WEBVTT

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:07.380
Hey, I'm going to show you how you can get the API set up

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:09.420
for this environment.

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:16.580
You need to go to Lumen, log in,

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:20.080
then you go to profile, and you scroll down,

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:25.840
you click new API key, and you just copy the key.

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:28.780
Just to give you a background,

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.460
if you don't have the model set up,

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:33.580
you should go up here, to glm-5.3-flash,

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:37.020
and consent, something will pop up here,

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.060
asking you to consent.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:42.460
So make sure to consent the model to be used.

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:46.260
And yeah, you should be all good to go.

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:48.860
You should be good to go; it's just a sign-in.

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:52.020
And yeah, let me know if you have any questions.
